# K03 (Codex K03-S5-ALIAS-VISIBILITY-20261007-07 Q2; docs/LMX_semantics.en.md:768, :937): a named Structure is a
# callable procedure, visible throughout its block in both directions.  m stands above Later and reads and writes
# its field: 4, then 6.  Exit 7; 81 or 82 if the path reached another place.
fn: m () int
    if: Later\v != 4U
        return: 81
    Later\v: 6U
    if: Later\v != 6U
        return: 82
    return: 7
end: m
Later:
    size_t: v 4U
end: Later
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
